/-!
# A216319

Irregular triangle: row n lists the odd numbers of the reduced residue system modulo n.

The 87 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A216319

/-- Known terms of `flat`, starting at index `1`. -/
def flatData : List flatRetType :=
  [1, 1, 1, 1, 3, 1, 3, 1, 5, 1,
    3, 5, 1, 3, 5, 7, 1, 5, 7, 1,
    3, 7, 9, 1, 3, 5, 7, 9, 1, 5,
